I think it may depend on what version you're playing...
I know that in version 2, when your pet eats food off of the floor, it will
eat the entire group of that food (ie: if there were 24000 tr's he'd eat them
all as if there were only 1... But it may take him/her/it a tad longer)
In version 3.1j your pet will only eat one item at a time and usually move off
of the pile before jumping back on again and eating another (if it's still
hungry that is)
I could be wrong but this is what I've observed and am not sure how other
version treat the same.

